      <activity id="85ed260b-6998-51d1-aa4d-72be08fbc9c7" activityNameId="178c67d0-a126-55f9-94d7-c94864cdcfe4" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Electric scooter, at regional storage</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Electric scooter, at regional storage
The data set reflects a scooter running 60-70 km/h at max. speed. Corresponding 50cc .Manufacturing in Asia. ;
Synonyms: eScooter, eRoller; 
UUID: 771e9b72-d823-3500-b8e8-e34e9efc7265
This data set includes all processes and materials for eScooter manufacturing, containing a LiIo battery. Transport to regional storage included.
Location: Data for manufacturing in Asia and retail in Europe
Technology: Automised production of small e-scooters. LiMn2O4 battery pack, 100Wh/kg.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature, manufacturer data 
Extrapolations: All values extrapolated from BEV production. Some adaptations made for change of material.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_771e9b72-d823-3500-b8e8-e34e9efc7265.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
